Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.78,0:00:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's safe to say Venice is\Nfree of Hitman from the Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.20,0:00:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in the clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.50,0:00:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head to the airport now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.50,0:00:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We're taking to the skies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.28,0:00:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll get us to our next destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.90,0:00:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We are headed for the Isle of Sardinia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're to succeed, it's imperative\Nthat we uncover the boss's past.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.06,0:00:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Our lives depend on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.12,0:00:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not picking up any foreign life forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.42,0:00:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We should be good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.58,0:00:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not even so much as a\Ncockroach on board this plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.06,0:00:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good. Because it's ours now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.22,0:00:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're to keep everything away from\Nthis plane, living or otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.86,0:00:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we take off,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.20,0:00:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll be flying at nearly\N800 kilometers an hour,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.86,0:00:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and at an altitude of\Nseveral thousand meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.72,0:01:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Luckily for us, it'd be impossible\Nfor a user to give chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.44,0:01:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A Stan couldn't keep up with\Nus at that height and speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.48,0:01:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.64,0:01:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sardinia is waiting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.26,0:01:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Our total flight time\Nwill be about two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.50,0:01:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.18,0:02:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.18,0:02:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Chishinya don't need a Nunzio.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.08,0:02:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear the honobiru, Diego.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.42,0:02:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I nori wokie. Help you! Hell no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.82,0:02:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hachimari no gobelin!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.80,0:02:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.18,0:02:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing don't you\Nthink that's dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.56,0:02:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,how do you even know for\Nsure the last trip the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.38,0:02:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,captain took was to\NSardinia there's this thing
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.94,0:03:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,called INS apparently\Nyou put your destination
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.86,0:03:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,in the plane's computer\Nand it automatically
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.92,0:03:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,takes you there saw it in\Na movie once i find the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.60,0:03:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,INS and enter our\Ndestination we'll be good to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.58,0:03:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, you're basing your plan\Non a movie. Well, Abacchio.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.20,0:03:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,how much longer until\Nwe take off? Not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.72,0:03:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one thing I can't fast-forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.56,0:03:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe ten minutes or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.46,0:03:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati's leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.66,0:03:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure he badly\Ninjured it in the last battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.26,0:03:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How could a gash that\Ndeep not be gushing blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.30,0:03:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahead to the left!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.62,0:03:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got company coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.88,0:03:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's getting closer! Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.26,0:03:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.17,0:03:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay right where you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.78,0:03:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take this the wrong way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.50,0:03:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're a perfectly nice guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.38,0:03:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,but if you keep skulking around this\Nplane, I'll have to gun your ass down!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.32,0:04:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Though,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.23,0:04:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,the way your creeper ass is\Nstill lumbering toward us,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.26,0:04:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to get the feeling you\Nmight not be that nice of a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.70,0:04:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So let me be clear, get lost or get dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.84,0:04:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you the benefit of the doubt\Nand assume your ears were all clogged up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.04,0:04:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, unclog and get this through your\Nskull, because I won't say it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.04,0:04:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Walk away, or I start painting\Nthe runway with your plot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.66,0:04:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a stand user!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.22,0:04:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Six bullets!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.08,0:04:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yahoo! Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.82,0:04:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno! Narancia!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.20,0:04:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got another enemy on our hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.34,0:04:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The signal disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.12,0:04:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like he was the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.88,0:04:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't currently see\Nanyone else near our plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.18,0:04:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it, Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.54,0:04:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That Katsone's history.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.44,0:04:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave him be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.66,0:04:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.66,0:04:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.58,0:05:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But we can't be too careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.62,0:05:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think that was too easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.20,0:05:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost as if he\Nwanted you to shoot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.68,0:05:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's with all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.36,0:05:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that a dig at me and six bullets?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.64,0:05:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting jealous of our\Nskills isn't a good look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.50,0:05:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Fact is, he sucks and we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.56,0:05:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're goddamn right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.12,0:05:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no question that he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.22,0:05:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.46,0:05:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no pulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.62,0:05:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And his life energy's vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.72,0:05:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista! Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.98,0:05:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We're about to take off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.18,0:05:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.20,0:05:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Our ride's calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.02,0:06:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if my father, rather...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.20,0:06:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if your boss ever thought I'd
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.22,0:06:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,travel to Sardinia to\Nuncover his hidden past.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.70,0:06:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Former boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.72,0:06:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.82,0:06:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,With him and his madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.90,0:06:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Insofar as his machinations go, he shrewd.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.22,0:06:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Assuming he's predicted our plan,\Nthis info's even more vital.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.06,0:06:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I suspect that at the time he\Nmet your mother in Sardinia,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.88,0:06:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,he wasn't yet a mafioso in hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.58,0:06:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he was most likely\Njust an ordinary young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.20,0:06:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He joined the mafia sometime later,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.58,0:06:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,which means something\Nfrom his previous life
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.44,0:06:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,will tell us who the boss\Nreally was 15 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.92,0:06:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And you are the best person to\Nfind that something. Think back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.72,0:06:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.22,0:06:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you think of any\Nstories from your childhood?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.56,0:06:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe some your mother used to tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.50,0:06:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill di Volpe. There.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.12,0:06:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill di Volpe?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.90,0:06:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The Bay of the Fox?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.28,0:07:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.20,0:07:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a rather famous resort\Non the costa Smeralda.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.00,0:07:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,She said that's how the two of them\Nmet, while she was on vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.90,0:07:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,She also told me that my\Nfather grew up in Sardinia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.34,0:07:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, he spoke\Nwith a Sardinian dialect.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.84,0:07:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he just up and vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.88,0:07:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom never found out anything else\Nabout him, not even his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.62,0:07:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's everything I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.96,0:07:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond that, I'm at a loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.60,0:07:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides, it's just\Nmy mom's reminiscing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.18,0:07:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the only living\Nrelative the boss has left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.48,0:07:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You threaten his precious anonymity,\Nwhich is why he's fighting to end you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.24,0:07:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Squalo di Volpe, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.26,0:07:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the name of our first actual lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.50,0:07:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, you might want to\Nstart getting your gun ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.20,0:07:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take a listen to this sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.32,0:08:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.94,0:08:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you talking about the engine?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.02,0:08:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not making sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.38,0:08:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, just get out your gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.96,0:08:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in the cabinet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.30,0:08:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.88,0:08:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what it is,\Nbut something's up with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.60,0:08:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we got on, didn't you say there\Nwasn't even a cockroach on this damn thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.64,0:08:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.84,0:08:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm still not picking up\Non any life force on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.24,0:08:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.15,0:08:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But what, Giorno?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.54,0:08:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to tell me we have\Na long-distance stand on board?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.04,0:08:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure you're not just a\Nlittle loose in the noodle?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.74,0:08:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, I suppose\Nthat's a possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.54,0:08:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.36,0:08:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard something concerning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.38,0:08:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm opening the cabinet, which\Nis why I need your gun ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.64,0:08:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A freezer?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.80,0:08:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.30,0:08:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess my nerves simply\Ngot the better of me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.74,0:08:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Chorno, what the hell\Nkind of joke is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.60,0:09:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you have time to\Nput that in the freezer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.94,0:09:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.85,0:09:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you trying to scare me with those\Ncrusty chicken scraps or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.50,0:09:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.41,0:09:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Your sense of humor sucks to high heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.82,0:09:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not chicken at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.42,0:09:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There is blood, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.92,0:09:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like it's still fresh, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.82,0:09:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.73,0:09:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't those the fingers of that mozzarella\Nball I knocked off back at the airport?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.52,0:09:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, tell me I'm wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.20,0:09:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, just calm down, Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.76,0:09:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There's another one in there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.94,0:09:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.96,0:09:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Something I should know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.58,0:09:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, when we came aboard this aircraft,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.40,0:09:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,you were positive that it\Nwas devoid of any life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.28,0:09:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But now Mista is saying he witnessed\Nthree severed fingers multiply to four.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.08,0:09:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How is this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.54,0:09:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they not giving off any energy at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.64,0:09:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They're inanimate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.26,0:10:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No life whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.78,0:10:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If they were just animate,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.44,0:10:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,or even if they were\Nsome sort of new stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.48,0:10:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden Wind's power simply wouldn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.62,0:10:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Plant life would never sprout from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.64,0:10:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, you guys, I know those multiplying\Nzombie digits really spooked me out,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.36,0:10:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,but let's be real, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.62,0:10:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I was probably just seeing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.80,0:10:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, why are these stupid freaking\Nfingers on this stupid freaking plane?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.08,0:10:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I'd like to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.16,0:10:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone planted these here, but\Nthe how and who elude us for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.52,0:10:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless, they have to go. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.98,0:10:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't mean off the plane, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.08,0:10:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But you can't open the\Ndoor while we're airborne.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.38,0:10:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get sucked out like turds\Nbeing flung down the toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.66,0:10:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.96,0:10:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Open her up, Zipperman!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.54,0:10:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the job is finished\Nand with nary a soul flung.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.54,0:10:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure there are no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.22,0:10:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Check every crevice of this plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.68,0:11:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I could go for\Nsome pizza too. Nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.94,0:11:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Complicated, just a pizza\Nmargarita from Napoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.30,0:11:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck is this\Na train station stall
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.08,0:11:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,what's with the graffiti\Nisn't this some rich
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.42,0:11:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,guy's plane?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.33,0:11:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.08,0:11:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The name of that guy's stand is
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.10,0:11:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Notorious chase. Who in the hell wrote
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.74,0:12:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,this and when what would the Stan\Nhave to gain by doing this what
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.14,0:12:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,These fingers no it can't be\NBucciarati just threw them
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.46,0:12:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Outside, we didn't touch. Is\Nthis what wrote the graffiti?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.24,0:12:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it a corpse?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.12,0:12:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.14,0:12:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Its user is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.76,0:12:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So the stand has to be too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.82,0:12:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Merida!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.73,0:12:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fading on my body and getting bigger!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.48,0:12:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.24,0:12:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Pack off my right arm fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.70,0:12:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! What in the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.52,0:12:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks exactly like my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.22,0:12:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.13,0:12:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's devouring my stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.44,0:12:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who wrote that\Ngraffiti on the wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.58,0:12:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He brought those fingers aboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.44,0:12:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.02,0:12:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the problem, Giorno?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.68,0:13:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you good?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.22,0:13:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.10,0:13:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.06,0:13:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.16,0:13:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You better start making a replacement arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.36,0:13:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.90,0:13:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.62,0:13:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he just try to pounce\Non Golden Wind's arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.90,0:13:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on, Giorno?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.60,0:13:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is madness!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.52,0:13:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget everything you know about stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.82,0:13:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We've never seen this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.76,0:13:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If that aberration is a stand, then\Nits user has to be hiding somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.10,0:13:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.08,0:13:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We already killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.92,0:13:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Back there on the runway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.04,0:13:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew there was something\Nweird about the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.62,0:13:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He approached us so he could die and let\Nhis stand hunt us down from the skies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.84,0:13:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,His essence lives on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.44,0:13:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems being killed triggered\Nthe emergence of his stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.26,0:13:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It has no user, so it can keep up\Nwithout being tethered to a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.58,0:13:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.68,0:13:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as slow as a slug.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.30,0:14:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, since it's not\Nmoving, you think it's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.98,0:14:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Has to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.92,0:14:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,After being blasted, it's not moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.88,0:14:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No. No. Run. Shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.42,0:14:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's It's feeding, it\Ndoesn't need to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.06,0:14:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I got too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.36,0:14:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This bastard is quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.36,0:14:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn thing got my bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.90,0:14:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It got four of them, more than half.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.38,0:14:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Number two, three, six, seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.16,0:14:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's deadly, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.92,0:14:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.06,0:14:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back, all of you. Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.44,0:14:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Not good, stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.02,0:14:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.80,0:14:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it going after Narancia?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.22,0:14:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's got to have some method\Nof discerning its next victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.76,0:14:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think I'm scared of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.88,0:14:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All I gotta do is keep my distance?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.26,0:14:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, nice thing is I don't have\Nto get close to fill you full of holes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.30,0:15:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That movement, so I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.10,0:15:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It is detecting something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.20,0:15:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.11,0:15:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.26,0:15:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't keep up with that speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.14,0:15:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, that meat monster of\Na stand is gonna slaughter us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.32,0:15:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia! Quick, Trish!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.24,0:15:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hide in the closet and stay quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.34,0:15:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What oh no, what's it one with\NTrish? Get it and shut the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.12,0:15:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand I know what it's tracking
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.72,0:15:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,it's movement moving objects trigger it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.30,0:15:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,to zero in for the kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.64,0:15:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That explains how it's choosing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.90,0:15:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The more swiftly its target moves,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.10,0:16:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,the more voraciously it seeks\Nto consume its panicking prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.86,0:16:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can just get this thing off my\Nleft arm, we can all make it to Sardinia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.70,0:16:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our only option now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.02,0:16:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be like this never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.10,0:16:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait, Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.12,0:16:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.03,0:16:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You use your stand to recover injuries!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.76,0:16:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do that if you lose both arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.24,0:16:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Make it latch onto me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.94,0:16:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll deal with it myself! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.46,0:16:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're out of time, Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.60,0:16:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's starting to creep up my arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.08,0:16:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.99,0:16:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.88,0:16:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Jean!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.24,0:16:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We were so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.44,0:16:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sardinia was within reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.00,0:16:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista and Narancia are…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.82,0:17:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.94,0:17:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All this happened because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.04,0:17:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I decided to bring\Nmy team onto this plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.82,0:17:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I ignored every single pitfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.28,0:17:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my mistake to own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.94,0:17:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No one could have\Nanticipated this. No one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.52,0:17:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Being on this plane\Ngranted us the opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.08,0:17:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,to rid ourselves of that stand for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.52,0:17:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to do something\Nabout their injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.24,0:17:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They're serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.20,0:17:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They can start recovering in the turtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.62,0:17:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, about their injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.42,0:17:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.08,0:17:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,His arms, they can be replaced.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.40,0:17:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.90,0:17:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,His stand, Golden Wind,\Nhas the power to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.38,0:17:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden Wind and Zipperman\Ncan only actuate their powers
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.80,0:17:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,through direct contact\Nwith their hands and fists.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.00,0:17:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither of us have ever suffered\Ndamage like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.96,0:17:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno Giovanna is out of commission.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.14,0:18:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means, so are Mista and Arantxa.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.10,0:18:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno has no way of\Nregenerating his arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.44,0:18:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish, you should get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.70,0:18:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bring a Bacchio up to\Nspeed on what's happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.22,0:18:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.13,0:18:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm traveling to Sardinia\Nfor my own benefit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.44,0:18:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,For me, and me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.28,0:18:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,All of this bloodshed due to me\Nwanting to learn about my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.14,0:18:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Only because it serves my interests.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.36,0:18:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But Giorno and the others are different.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.74,0:18:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not concerned\Nabout their own safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.88,0:18:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,They're fighting for what they\Nbelieve is right and just.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.46,0:18:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,As I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.88,0:19:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I could ever do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.26,0:19:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that a ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.96,0:19:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is a ball out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.54,0:20:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.30,0:20:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell was it not sent\Nflying from the airplane?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.12,0:20:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, of course it didn't fly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.92,0:20:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Journal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.32,0:20:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's movement.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.58,0:20:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Moving objects trigger it\Nto zero in for the kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.28,0:20:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That explains how it's choosing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.34,0:20:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We're flying through\Nthe air at a high speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.70,0:20:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's drawn to whatever\Nobject is moving fastest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.24,0:20:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That would certainly explain\Nwhy it went after the knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.00,0:20:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to get into the\Ncloset and shut the door now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.22,0:20:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Slowly, I have to move slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.26,0:20:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Slow but with purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.94,0:20:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I can detect anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.18,0:21:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd it change direction all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.70,0:21:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Something must have set it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.90,0:21:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Giorno's brooch?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.26,0:21:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,C-could it be alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.32,0:21:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden wind is transforming.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.40,0:21:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it turning into Giorno's arms?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.36,0:21:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,His left hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.76,0:21:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.04,0:21:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's forming a brand new hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.68,0:21:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Before he severed his arm,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.68,0:21:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno had already begun\Ngrowing a replacement.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.70,0:21:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,by infusing the ladybug\Nwith life-giving energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.82,0:21:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno's not going down\Nwithout a hell of a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.54,0:21:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I keep that\Nthing away from his hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.10,0:21:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia and Mista might have a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.48,0:21:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But how the hell do I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.48,0:22:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They were accusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.14,0:22:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They've always been knowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.20,0:22:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What is just fiction?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.50,0:22:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Or what is the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.52,0:22:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They have a mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.62,0:22:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They are the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.60,0:22:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But they dare to tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.02,0:22:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What's bad and what's good?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.80,0:22:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.22,0:22:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Join us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.34,0:22:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.24,0:22:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just say this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.18,0:22:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We are the power!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.18,0:22:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.36,0:22:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,As we are fighters!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.38,0:22:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just fighting for a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.18,0:23:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
